# The three things that must never reach a forge.
#
# This repo is public on GitHub, Codeberg and GitLab. Everything else in this
# wing is written to be read by the world — including by the people it catches.
#
# NOTE: a pattern must sit alone on its line. Git does not honour a trailing
# comment, so `placements.jsonl  # secret` silently matches nothing. That exact
# mistake was made here once, and caught by testing the ignore rather than
# trusting it. declared != wired, including this file.

# where each bait actually sits — the only real secret in the wing
placements.jsonl

# so a user-agent digest cannot be dictionary-reversed
.salt

# which traps are live right now
.armed

# live exposures — a map of our own open doors. never committed.
.fires.md
